WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Heavy wind Spire completes the prerequisite knockdown.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.250
Lily closes with two forward dashes.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.550
The retreat leaves Ryu’s recorded throw out of range.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.550
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.250
Forward heavy punch continues the punish.

6
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:03.900
Heavy Condor Wind completes the three-hit punish.

7
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.600
Ryu falls and Lily retains the gained Wind stock.
